  "releaseNotes": "v7.6.0 adds RagEnabledService.StartRunAsync with one retrieval pass, streaming, cancellation, and supported steering; forwards request-scoped reasoning and hosted search to the final answer; and fixes all-duplicate source lists being embedded again. Existing completion and streaming APIs remain available. Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 3.1.0 and Mythosia.AI.Rag.Abstractions 6.2.0. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v760",
